{"3832210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kingdom Conquer", "steam_appid": 3832210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are not a distant ruler.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kingdom Conquer</strong>, you lead a growing Norse clan from a handful of survivors into a thriving kingdom built entirely by your own hands:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place every building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command every villager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight every battle yourself.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Realm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/26934ef5974fe5f35c7d62fbdd8017bf.poster.avif?t=1787792388\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/26934ef5974fe5f35c7d62fbdd8017bf.webm?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/26934ef5974fe5f35c7d62fbdd8017bf.mp4?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand tile-by-tile across a seamless, persistent world.<br>Establish settlements, resource outposts, defences and industry to support your people and fuel your war effort.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Among Your People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/6208b07cd9e680d8338250d737ca2f52.poster.avif?t=1787792388\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/6208b07cd9e680d8338250d737ca2f52.webm?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/6208b07cd9e680d8338250d737ca2f52.mp4?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers are not background units, they live beside you.<br>Assign roles, give orders in real time, and watch your society function around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight For The Land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b1626797061cb142c09ad9570150d2a1.poster.avif?t=1787792388\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b1626797061cb142c09ad9570150d2a1.webm?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b1626797061cb142c09ad9570150d2a1.mp4?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When war comes, you're right there in the fight.<br>Lead charges, defend raids, and invade rival territories to secure your future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/3844efb88129eb0037980cff358f74fd.poster.avif?t=1787792388\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/3844efb88129eb0037980cff358f74fd.webm?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/3844efb88129eb0037980cff358f74fd.mp4?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive, procedurally generated land where every tile can be explored, conquered and reshaped.<br>As your borders expand so too does your economy, military strength and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are not a distant ruler.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kingdom Conquer</strong>, you lead a growing Norse clan from a handful of survivors into a thriving kingdom built entirely by your own hands:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place every building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command every villager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight every battle yourself.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Realm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/26934ef5974fe5f35c7d62fbdd8017bf.poster.avif?t=1787792388\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/26934ef5974fe5f35c7d62fbdd8017bf.webm?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/26934ef5974fe5f35c7d62fbdd8017bf.mp4?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand tile-by-tile across a seamless, persistent world.<br>Establish settlements, resource outposts, defences and industry to support your people and fuel your war effort.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Among Your People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/6208b07cd9e680d8338250d737ca2f52.poster.avif?t=1787792388\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/6208b07cd9e680d8338250d737ca2f52.webm?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/6208b07cd9e680d8338250d737ca2f52.mp4?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers are not background units, they live beside you.<br>Assign roles, give orders in real time, and watch your society function around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight For The Land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b1626797061cb142c09ad9570150d2a1.poster.avif?t=1787792388\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b1626797061cb142c09ad9570150d2a1.webm?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b1626797061cb142c09ad9570150d2a1.mp4?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When war comes, you're right there in the fight.<br>Lead charges, defend raids, and invade rival territories to secure your future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/3844efb88129eb0037980cff358f74fd.poster.avif?t=1787792388\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/3844efb88129eb0037980cff358f74fd.webm?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/3844efb88129eb0037980cff358f74fd.mp4?t=1787792388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive, procedurally generated land where every tile can be explored, conquered and reshaped.<br>As your borders expand so too does your economy, military strength and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A Viking first-person and strategy game. Claim territory, expand settlements, raise warriors, and grow your economy in turn-based KINGDOM mode before leading brutal raids into enemy lands to CONQUER.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/ba8d94c6cb3a597517852a70c2a16b40009cb0e4/header.jpg?t=1787792388", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/dbac5a9ffb35912ca73bb23d1736906851286969/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787792388", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/dbac5a9ffb35912ca73bb23d1736906851286969/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787792388", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 / AMD Radeon R7 260X (DirectX 11 compatible)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:<